WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.177
One small feature: add tags to ideas. Watch who touches it.

2
00:00:04.607 --> 00:00:06.098
The planner goes first.

3
00:00:06.128 --> 00:00:12.514
It reads the project and writes a plan: what changes, which files, and how you'll know it worked.

4
00:00:12.544 --> 00:00:13.705
It writes no code.

5
00:00:14.135 --> 00:00:18.241
The builder takes the plan and makes the smallest change that satisfies it.

6
00:00:18.271 --> 00:00:19.565
Then it runs every test.

7
00:00:19.995 --> 00:00:22.528
The reviewer never saw it being built.

8
00:00:22.558 --> 00:00:27.048
It reads the change cold, and answers with one word. Merge, or fix.

9
00:00:27.478 --> 00:00:34.441
If something breaks along the way, the debugger gathers evidence, names the cause, and cleans up after itself.

10
00:00:34.871 --> 00:00:38.931
Last, the writer updates the runbook to match what now exists.

11
00:00:39.361 --> 00:00:43.168
Five roles, each with a clean desk and one job. And you?

12
00:00:43.198 --> 00:00:46.457
You approved the plan, and you tried the result.
